  'Your choice fell on',
  'Your choice has fallen on',
  'The cosmos has turned your hand to',
  'The celestial wisdom has guided your selection to',
  'Your choice has led you to',
  'Your selection has fallen to',
  'And your twelfth card is',
];
const HOUSES     = [
  {
    "number": 1,
    "name": "yourself",
    "job": "Her present stance at the start of this, and what is in her own hands. Read the card as a stance she can recognize now, not as a personality verdict or an invented anecdote from her past.",
    "blurb": "how you meet the world, and what starts with you"
  },
  {
